    {
      "uid": "zhcn:251bee30ecde1cbd4e9196ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在风暴中欣赏花朵的人，真遗憾啊。\n我并非脆弱的花，而是划破天际的雷鸣！\n或许是因为这样吧──",
      "source_fingerprint": "781693bf6d1324d3cd28d5e9028f043df98580fb9831e8372cfed2bed8987603",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
