      "uid": "zhcn:95c20256b0e3be8485612b23",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有道微弱的雷鸣因吾的跑姿诞生了。\n那双有如新酒的双眼看着我，\n其中蕴含了纯粹的野心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "378294347166b0d08414d595d4ec746e312add06882eb21ebe96aad74f3f11dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
