      "uid": "zhcn:25d08f02ff5a99695630eb72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我破坏法则，称霸了“宝冢纪念”。\n我与战友一同反叛，破坏了命运。\n然后在这场比赛发现另一种命运──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a884348ec2516f457453c761c8f0dc071d6a47e14937710af0f1417abcd0fd09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
